(6) When discussing any records that are exempt from public inspection or disclosure pursuant to paragraph (15) of subsection (a) of O.C.G.A. § 50-18-72 (O.C.G.A. § 50-18-72(a)(15)), when discussing any information a record of which would be exempt from public inspection or disclosure under said paragraph, or when reviewing or discussing any security plan under consideration pursuant to paragraph (10) of subsection (a) of O.C.G.A. § 15-16-10 (O.C.G.A. § 15-16-10(a)(10)).
